bundle/golden.json is a test fixture: 70 query strings sampled from the collections below
(10 per collection; some are paraphrases this project generated from a sampled query), plus
22 queries written for this project. The strings are unchanged apart from that selection.

- BRIGHT, xlangai (https://huggingface.co/datasets/xlangai/BRIGHT), pony and theoremqa-questions
  splits, CC-BY-4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
- QUEST, cmalaviya (https://huggingface.co/datasets/cmalaviya/quest), Apache-2.0
  (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
- MIRACL, miracl (https://huggingface.co/datasets/miracl/miracl), English dev topics,
  Apache-2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
- LIMIT, Google DeepMind (https://github.com/google-deepmind/limit), CC-BY-4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
- ScIRGen-Geo, usail-hkust (https://huggingface.co/datasets/usail-hkust/ScIRGen-Geo), CC-BY-4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
- WANDS, Wayfair (https://github.com/wayfair/WANDS), MIT licence; copyright notice and licence
  text at https://github.com/wayfair/WANDS/blob/main/LICENSE.

bundle/arms.json holds router weights; each arm's `trained_lanes` lists the collections it was
trained on. The weights contain no text from them.

bundle/zipf_en.json is derived from the English "large" wordlist of wordfreq by Robyn Speer
(https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq), licensed CC-BY-SA 4.0 and distributed under the same licence.
